sgx: build the shared code in src/sgx

The ISA description, compiler, PDS and command stream code the gallium
driver uses live in src/sgx, as src/imagination does for the newer cores;
src/meson.build descends into it when the driver is built. The ISA, PDS
and csbgen trees are clang-format clean and opt in to enforcement.

diff --git a/.clang-format-include b/.clang-format-include
index 2b6f3c1..8d0e4a7 100644
--- a/.clang-format-include
+++ b/.clang-format-include
@@ -13,3 +13,6 @@ src/egl/**/*
 src/etnaviv/isa/**/*
 src/imagination/**/*
 src/kosmickrisp/**/*
+src/sgx/csbgen/**/*
+src/sgx/isa/**/*
+src/sgx/pds/**/*
diff --git a/src/meson.build b/src/meson.build
index c36f44b..95cf772 100644
--- a/src/meson.build
+++ b/src/meson.build
@@ -104,6 +104,9 @@ endif
 if with_gallium_panfrost or with_gallium_lima or with_panfrost_vk or with_tools.contains('panfrost')
   subdir('panfrost')
 endif
+if with_gallium_sgx
+  subdir('sgx')
+endif
 if with_microsoft_clc or with_gallium_d3d12 or with_spirv_to_dxil or with_microsoft_vk
   subdir('microsoft')
 endif
